Macrium Software. "Macrium Reflect" is a product of Paramount Software UK Ltd
and is a trademark of its respective owner; it is referenced in this project's
documentation solely for nominative purposes, to describe interoperability
context and feature-parity comparisons. No source code, binaries, or
marketing material from any proprietary product is used in OpenReflect.

File format
-----------
The OpenReflect image format (.orf) is an original, open format documented in
docs/FORMAT.md. It is not the file format of any other imaging product and is
not claimed to be compatible with one.

Third-party software
--------------------
OpenReflect is built on the .NET runtime (MIT license, .NET Foundation) and
targets Microsoft Windows. Windows, Volume Shadow Copy Service (VSS), and
Task Scheduler are products of Microsoft Corporation; references to them are
nominative.
